Notes for later waves:
  - The AC-18 probes (ScopedProbe, MissingDependency, NeedsMissingDependency)
    are private nested types in CompositionRootTests. They must never move into
    ModuleRegistration.
  - Route matching is case-insensitive by default, so /Health reaches the health
    endpoint. Recorded as an explicit test rather than left to be discovered.
  - HealthEndpointTests deliberately asserts nothing about GET / being unmapped.
    A first draft did, which would have broken the moment T03 mapped the root —
    in a file T03 does not own and therefore could not fix. The full endpoint
    inventory is AC-26 and belongs to T03.

